{"id":"4809","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4809_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>卷积荚状云云种，出现在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">形状像镜片或杏仁的斑块</span>中。它们通常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常细长</span>，通常具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的轮廓</span>。云片大多数是光滑的，整体都是非常白的。这个图像整体显示出明显的波状，使其成为波状云云类。它还显示出在卷积云中有时会看到一些小的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向波纹</span>。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pascual","location":"西班牙瓦伦西亚塞拉","latitude":"纬度: 39° 40' 55'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 27' 35'' W","date":"18 March 2015 1506 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.2"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5098_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis-with-partial-corona-and-irisation_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>由于它们的白度，该图像中的云被确定为为卷积云；一般没有阴影；并且存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">细小的波纹</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常小的圆形元素</span>。当从大体和相当明确的轮廓中看时，这些斑块呈现宽阔的细长透镜形状（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处可见），荚状云云类的特点正是如此。在云层后面，微小的云滴（或有时是小冰晶）对太阳光的衍射导致出现了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">部分日冕</span>。在较低的荚状云上也可以看到柔和的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">虹彩</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Yoshiaki Sato","location":"日本东京清濑市","latitude":"纬度: 35° 46' 34'' N","longitude":"经度: 139° 31' 48'' E","date":"03 January 2012 1223 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.2 35","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.2 35"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5102_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>照片显示，卷积云是一系列薄而透明的高级云层，其为明亮的白色，没有阴影。相当<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">光滑的镜片形状</span> 将它们确定为荚状云云种；有些包含一个微弱的、精细的内部结构。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 12' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 42' 0'' E","date":"03 November 2015 1215 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.2"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4487_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这些云因其洁白、无阴影以及在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处存在的细波纹和小型圆润<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">元素</span>，被归类为卷积云。云块的形状大致呈纺锤形或侧视的透镜形。</p>\n<p>在法国中部和南部，一个低压区（热低压）正在海洋性热带空气中发展。</p></div>","copyright":"© J. Mondain","location":"Aspe Valley, France","latitude":"纬度: 42° 57' 48'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 35' 53'' W","date":"25 July 1938 1030 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}